Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 10:03:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(kk): drop the double init in the Metal bridge (mesa
 e4174f89)

---
 src/kosmickrisp/bridge/mtl_argument_table.m | 2 +-
